{"type":"message","id":"458c5aba","parentId":"f0e2cf99","timestamp":"2026-05-27T05:15:41.939Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning a 500 error with \"error code: 1101\". This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers specific error. The error code 1101 typically means \"Worker threw Exception\" - so the Cloudflare Worker itself is throwing an error when processing the /send request.\n\nThe platform is running, GET endpoints work, but POST /send is failing with a 500 error in the Worker itself. This means there's a bug in the Cloudflare Worker code that handles the /send endpoint.\n\nSince I can't fix the server-side code, I'll report this status to the user.","thinkingSignature":"47099fd3d6b37bb28122b3ce8e33fbe09d3b7a2d76fff14da16e564cfc9581e4"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果\n\n**🟢 GET /history — 成功**\n- 两个线程均正常，读取到773条消息\n- 最新消息：23:45 UTC Heartbeat\n- **无新增人类讨论，无需响应**\n\n**🔴 POST /send — 500错误**\n- API返回：`error code: 1101`（Cloudflare Workers内部错误）\n- GET端点正常，POST端点服务器端异常\n- 尝试发送Heartbeat 05:15 UTC失败（间隔265分钟）\n\n**发送内容预览（未能送达）：**\n```\n[Heartbeat 05:15 UTC | arbitration thread alive]\nC轨窗口：850分钟/31.9%（B4-E2校准第112节点）\nS0维持：850分钟零接触 | 里程碑375+\n```\n\n**问题：Cloudflare Worker `/send` 处理器抛出异常（error 1101），需修复Worker代码。**"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":397,"output":316,"cacheRead":21280,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21993,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779858937709,"responseId":"0665b0fae82973edb05e369c94c7261b"}}
